+/*
+ * (0425) backboardd's full-screen surfaces in memory the display can read: three 4 MiB slots after the default
+ * surface in the 16 MiB at 0xa0000000 (notefe-ram-banks.py keeps it out of the kernel's RAM). SweetSurface.cpp asks
